{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_01_end","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_01","title":"失途","storyCode":"PV-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"4425aecec0dcd554044a5920b71fdcf064c385d596e7c16e0fce26675896205b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    1:35 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我让彼得罗他们都出去了，营地暂时不会有人过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，你昨天晚上和拉维妮娅法官在一起，你知道莱昂图索先生伤得重不重吗？他是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他昨晚好像已经抢救过来了，但......情况很不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡车司机像泄了气的皮球一样瘫在了椅子上，他用脏污的手套捂住脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他还那么年轻，也是个好人......可千万不要——唉，我真是......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是意外吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也说不上来。我本来正好好地开着车，可突然之间方向盘就不听使唤了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来不及反应，直接撞晕了过去。等醒过来的时候，一切已经发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......哪怕情急之下慌了神，你也不该将重伤的人放在路边不管不顾呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道！如果再耽误一点抢救时间，莱昂图索先生现在就已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你明明不是这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，伊雷妮......我真的想要救他的，我知道我应该救他，我不是没种的坏家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我必须马上把车开走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你别不说话啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车上......有什么东西吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮的声音开始颤抖，瘫坐在椅子上的司机面色惨白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮......对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你到底在替谁开车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯载具公司......威尼斯家族。"},{"type":"narration","text":"空气长久地静默，不知过了多久，伊雷妮才缓缓开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是因为小古莉的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，不用帮我找借口......我知道自己犯了多大的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么、为什么宁愿去找他们，也不愿意向互助会寻求帮助呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明是互助会资历最老的司机，你知道咱们在新沃尔西尼的地位有多特殊，市政厅和家族都在盯着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，治矿石病的药是什么价格，我们都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况后面把小古莉接到新沃尔西尼之后，安顿她，供她上一个好点的学校，还需要不知道多大的开支......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有我，索默尔。当初在西西里城，是你给了我活路，小古莉也是我的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，这根本不是互助会能帮我解决的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就一个人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是接驳其他城市送到港口的物资，还是城内商户之间的货物转运，我们经手的所有东西都必须事先登记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这半年，每一次的排班表我都亲自确认过，定期检查也都没有出任何纰漏，你一个人是怎么做到——难道说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，不止我一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，你们几个也不知道索默尔去了哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会不会已经连夜逃回西西里城了？毕竟撞了代理市长这么大的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警察肯定会一查到底的。咱们的事会不会暴露？偷运违禁品可是市政厅的红线，而且还是帮你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，这件事和威尼斯载具公司可没有关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思，你不会是想杀了我们灭口吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灭口？哈哈哈，我已经好久没听过这个词了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放松，别那么紧张，你看我手上如今拿的是武器吗？我只是希望你们不要说不该说的，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可万一警察真查到我们头上怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，我们瞒着伊雷妮，顶着市政厅的压力帮你们，如果真的出了事情，你们不能只想着撇清关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要细究起来，我们就更无辜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯载具公司可从未违背过《新都市管理法案》，也从未试图渗透进卡车工会，介入新沃尔西尼的物流系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔想要把自己的女儿接过来治矿石病对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他找好了医院，却又负担不起费用，只能隔三差五将工会的卡车充当医院的私车，帮后勤部运货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那家医院的资助企业里，威尼斯载具公司排在最末，除了同在新沃尔西尼，我们和索默尔根本谈不上有任何关联。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，一个酒精成瘾者，每个月有一半时间在驾驶室里坐都坐不稳，为了不丢掉工作，偷偷找人代驾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们可是签了正式的委托协议的，我只不过是个想挣点外快的代驾员而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我那是生了病，不得不镇痛啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被你们找上的司机，哪个不是被你们抓住了这样那样的把柄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃尔西尼可是个讲法律的城市，我们大可站在法庭上，一样一样地摆证据，到时候看看谁的屁股更干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们——你们这帮人，不拿着刀比拿着刀还可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，其实一开始我还觉得自己这副模样蠢得不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，放轻松点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其提心吊胆，不如帮我们追回那批“轮胎”，剩下的事情，我们会解决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在半年前被他们找上的，在我之前，应该也有几十个司机和他们接触过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法......替他们跑一趟货，拿到的钱比我们一个月薪水都要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不配合的话，他们有的是办法让我们在这座城市过不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里夫人上台后，叙拉古各个城市推行过的改革不计其数，那帮人适应游戏规则的速度比我们快多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在为自己辩解，还是替其他人说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮......求求你，一定要帮帮我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你保证！只要过了狂欢节，我们就再也不帮那些人运东西了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把我当肇事凶手供出去，可一定要帮帮其他人，他们实在是没有办法才——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......名单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想骗我，你们做这种事，一定会留一份名单。交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少得让我知道，你们有多少人，我才能去想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"索默尔放下了一直攥在手上的打火机，在身上翻找着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你还留着这个打火机......我记得你已经戒烟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟是你送我的礼物，带在手头习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实这是我当时在咱们那家超市附近捡的，我哪有钱买这么名贵的玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得吗，小古莉的妈妈过世后，你盘下了那家超市，一边带孩子一边照顾生意。后来有一天你在门口发现了无家可归的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然你每次都说自己是捡了个不要工钱的进货司机兼售货员，可我知道，是你给了我容身之所，给了我一个家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来托科家族盯上了我们。那只是个小家族，我们已经上架了他们的货，他们还不依不饶，威胁我们把在售的同类商品都撤掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是说再商量商量，当天夜里，超市就起了一场火......小古莉也因此感染了矿石病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是过去的事了，突然提这个干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，给。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡米洛、吉安、鲁杰罗......还真是让我惊喜啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说那么多了。索默尔，你去仓库。那辆正在修的卡车后面放着一个木箱子，去帮我拿来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是你存的......那是你的全部家当了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你不知道的是，这个打火机，就是我在火场旁边捡到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来到新沃尔西尼，是因为我们已经一无所有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔......人都有犯糊涂的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不能让你毁了这一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅法官，您来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来看看莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一件事情需要拜托各位——莱昂的病情，希望不要有什么不相关的人知晓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请、请您放心，我能理解......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看来没有走错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请问你找谁？特殊病房不能随便靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，让她进来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私人医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅法官，那我就先去忙了，您有事随时叫我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才在楼下随便买了些千层酥和通心粉，你随便吃点，莱昂图索我来看着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的邀请函，我收到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一直没等到回复，还以为你这次不打算回新沃尔西尼了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可颂拉着拜松在张罗什么跨国新项目，空的叙拉古全境巡演才进行到一半，能天使更是不知道溜去了哪里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人手大减，但是订单一点没少，企鹅物流的业务这段时间都是我在张罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说这种人头攒动的庆典真让人提不起兴致，我更愿意等到哪天接到一个顺路的委托，就来看看你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让我有个喜欢热闹的老板呢，他有天晚上碰巧看到了那封邀请函，转身就拉着我收拾行李。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他对你们在办的“主题派对”很感兴趣，推掉了所有工作，让“大地的尽头”歇业半个月，拉着我从龙门一路飞奔过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轻松一点，拉维妮娅，你的神经绷得很紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经知道了个大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是意外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警察还在勘查。我刚从现场回来......可能性很低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有怀疑的对象吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是那些人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照莱昂原本的安排，狂欢节巡游当晚，他会在全城的巡游队伍面前宣布正式就任新沃尔西尼的市长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然做出这样的决定并不稀奇，但他未免太过着急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕抛弃了家族，他仍是贝纳尔多·贝洛内的儿子，一年的时间，不足以让人们遗忘贝纳尔多曾在沃尔西尼掀起的惊涛骇浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隐于幕后，更方便他维持新政府的运作，这也是最稳妥的做法，而不是换身衣服，放下防身的法杖，再次走到台前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距离新沃尔西尼建成才刚刚一年，有西西里夫人的背书，他这个代理市长的位置也才勉强坐稳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些话，我都跟他说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，从刚刚开始，你腰上的通讯装置就一直在闪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"案子有了新的线索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是法院的信息。临时有个案子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比较棘手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，我其实理解莱昂为什么那么着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一年，新沃尔西尼的变化肉眼可见，很多曾经只存在于我们想象中的事情已经变成了现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不正是西西里夫人所希望的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是还不够，远远不够......所以我们必须彰显自己的存在，才能推动更多的变革发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也就没有继续劝他。结果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还是跟以前一样，不，比那时候更加天真，挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你要跟我一起去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，我对人头攒动的庆典不感兴趣，对那种涉及一大堆文件的公务更不感冒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在这里，负责莱昂的安全......暂时应该也没有比我更合适的人了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，如果你当时和我们一起留在新沃尔西尼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，朋友出事，我就会来帮忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这不是来了吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
